SPECIAL ISSUE ARTICLE
The student staffing advantage: Data Science Consulting
Service at NC State University Libraries
Joddy Marchesoni 1 | Kate Freeman 1 | Alp Tezbasaran 1,2,3 |
Shannon W. Ricci 1
1Data & Visualization Services, NC State University Libraries, Raleigh, North Carolina, USA
