are the busiest days, with fewer consultations scheduled on Fridays and the weekends. These trends inform how we lay out service hours each
year, so a large increase in counts for a specific day could lead to scheduling more consultants for that time of the following year. In the past, we
experimented with different shift arrangements to discover when patron demand would be highest, and the current schedule reflects our
